    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_328_cammou"
    },
    {
        "text": "C'mon, over here!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Click"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_294_ayer"
    },
    {
        "text": "The markings here... they look like they're simply venting.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ayerscarpe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_367_swllow_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Severin thought this was some kind of calculated sabotage. But was it, actually? This really does look like senseless violence.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
        "name2": "char_328_cammou",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Click, did you find something?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
        "name2": "char_328_cammou",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Sure did. But...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Click"
    },
    {
        "text": "Can you come here, GreyThroat? I... I don't know how to say this...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Click"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
        "name2": "char_328_cammou",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What is it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
        "name2": "char_328_cammou",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "In that room...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Click"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_367_swllow_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your pupils are red again. Control yourself. Don't be afraid. Ayerscarpe, stay outside with her. Warn the mob.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_294_ayer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Roger.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ayerscarpe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_367_swllow_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "In here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_black",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "(It's a mess. Someone's last desperate stand... Ugh... are these... frozen limbs?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Wait, who is this?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_ltstreet2",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$frontline_intro",
        "key": "$frontline_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_067"
    },
    {
        "text": "Gah! She's a doctor?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Armed Infected"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you don't leave, we'll kill you too!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Armed Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_345_folnic_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "The solution I just sprayed on you is both volatile and toxic.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_067"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wha?! Wh-what did you do to us?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Armed Infected"
    },
    {
        "text": "Out with it! Or I'll... I'll... Ugh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Armed Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_345_folnic_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "How do you feel?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tell me where Biederman is and I'll give you the antidote. Or you can enjoy spending the next few hours vomiting between hallucination episodes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_067"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're sick... I... I don't know... any Biederman. I just... have to kill all... the nobles... nng...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Armed Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_345_folnic_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then I'm afraid you're all going to stay in jail.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_067"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? A mushroom? That's a big mushroom... Why is it... moving? Why is it biting?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Armed Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_ltstreet2",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "avg_npc_069#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Schultz! We have more wounded! A lot of them! The insurgents took over the market and Maibaumplatz. But many more people are still trapped in Zw\u00f6lftontechnik Strasse.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "text": "They're unstoppable!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "avg_npc_069#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Once the fighting started, we lost all hope of stopping anything.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now we face two possible outcomes: Surrender, or fight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "avg_npc_069#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What should we do?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066"
    },
    {
        "text": "Surrender, hand over the city to Reunion and the insurgents, and go starve to death in the snow.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "text": "If we fight, both sides end up wounded or dead, and the survivors will starve to death in the snow.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "text": "Or...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "text": "If casualties are unavoidable, we want the fewest possible\u2014*cough* *cough*, *hack*\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 30,
        "fadeout": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Ack... *cough* *cough* *cough*, *cough* *hack* *cough*\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Schultz\u2014 Uncle? Uncle??",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey! Uncle, that's blood. You're coughing up blood!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry! Just a second! Miss Tatjana!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_069#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "My uncle, he can't speak and\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you okay? Abnormal breathing, lung lesions resulting in a loss of voice, this calls for... it calls for...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#2",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What happened?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Mr. Severin, he's actually\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You should listen to the doctor and quit smoking. We don't need a test to see you have some serious persistent lung damage.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_345_folnic_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let me see here... I need to take this off\u2014\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey! Don't move!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_345_folnic_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "You... you're Infected?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069#4"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 30,
        "fadeout": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_345_folnic_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "These are Oripathy symptoms. The Originium is pushing out from his lungs into his throat. This dark powdery substance below your throat... that's Originium crystals surfacing through your skin.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your cells have begun fusing with the Originium. Is this why you don't care about your health?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did he get it from the battle just now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069#4",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "This isn't an early symptom or an acute lesion. He's been Infected for some time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "text": "Probably from the Catastrophe... No, that's too recent. It must have been even before that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066#3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": false
    },
    {
        "text": "*Cough* *cough*\u2014\u2014*cough* *cough* *cough*!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_345_folnic_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Black blood clots. Suzuran, take a sample.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Okay! Sorry, sir. I'll be quick.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_345_folnic_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "No way the hospital is functioning right now. Okay, take him into the town hall!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wolumonde... can't be without... her Schultz!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "If you keep pushing yourself, she's definitely going to lose him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You... really look like a doctor right now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "text": "*Cough* cough*, *cough* *cough*\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "text": "Phew, looks like I can talk for a minute after coughing up blood. Handy, that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Tough guy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I have a favor to ask.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Say your piece, but I'm taking you in. Lisa, hold him. Tatjana, help me lift.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069#4",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Right!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066"
    },
    {
        "text": "Please, everyone, *cough* *cough*, don't tell anyone I'm Infected...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then, I'll admit that I was the murderer who set the fire. I was the cause of all Wolumonde's problems...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "And what of the real killer?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't care. I can't.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "text": "But at least... they'll have their scapegoat, and no excuse to keep fighting.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "text": "But it's not enough... Without an external force strong enough to clamp down on them, they'll continue their cycle of revenge.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "text": "So I request... Rhodes Island's assistance... Even though we can't afford to pay for it now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "text": "But if Wolumonde survives this disaster... we will repay you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We aren't a charity.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066#5",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm begging you!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066#5",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't have the authority to make promises on behalf of Rhodes Island. Saving a town of ten thousand people is beyond the scope of our mission, and way beyond the authority Amiya invested in me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "text": "But, for Atro, 'we' won't abandon Wolumonde.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_ltroom",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$darkness02_intro",
        "key": "$darkness02_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.6,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_345_folnic_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "Stand aside, we have a wounded\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_367_swllow_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_345_folnic_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "GreyThroat? Why are you alone?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "text": "Suzuran, take the Schultz to the upstairs parlor. And don't let anyone see you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "text": "Brutal as it may be, once he settles down, Schultz Severin is going to have to stand up and lead again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#2",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Roger that! I'll take care of it!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069#2",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Tatjana.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069#2",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "There are riots all over town. People are getting hurt or killed. I... I can't just sit here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll go organize the militia that didn't get caught up in the riot. At least... at least I can do something.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Sure. Go ahead.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_345_folnic_1#3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Can we talk?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "We found Biederman.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "text": "We need to capture him immediately and end the riots, we have to avenge Atro\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat"
    },
    {
        "text": "He's dead.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...What?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_367_swllow_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We found him on the 'Gramophone' at coordinate B2.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat"
    },
    {
        "text": "There were visible wounds on the back of his head, and ice crystals remained on the surface of his skin. All signs indicated an Arts attack.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat"
    },
    {
        "text": "The operator on scene could not make an accurate determination, but wounds on the surrounding cadavers indicated that Biederman had died in the riot at least a few hours prior.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat"
    },
    {
        "text": "Biederman is dead. But the riots continue. We all know what that means.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat"
    },
    {
        "text": "Click and Ayerscarpe are searching his residence. Unless they run into trouble\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait...! You said, you said he's already dead?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "If you really need me to repeat myself, yes, he is already dead.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0.3,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I watched as the smile on Folinic's face froze\u2014 Yes, that smile."
    },
    {
        "text": "The loss of Operator Atro left her emotionally unstable, until we learned about Biederman."
    },
    {
        "text": "No longer troubled with issues of colonialism, the Infected, or class, she simply, and happily, found her revenge."
    },
    {
        "text": "Does she feel some momentary relief? Relief at having realized her goal?"
    },
    {
        "text": "What next? How am I to deal with this new... condition of hers?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_towerinside",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$nervous_intro",
        "key": "$nervous_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_294_ayer",
        "name2": "char_328_cammou",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "So it is.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ayerscarpe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_294_ayer",
        "name2": "char_328_cammou",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Click"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_294_ayer",
        "name2": "char_328_cammou",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "A Contingency Contract operation agreement. Signed by one Catastrophe Messenger Biederman.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ayerscarpe"
    },
    {
        "text": "So then, was it all part of the plan? Including your own death, Biederman?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ayerscarpe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_294_ayer",
        "name2": "char_328_cammou",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm... but why? Could that Contingency thingamajig be the real mastermind?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Click"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_294_ayer",
        "name2": "char_328_cammou",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Letting people die in a Catastrophe is not really their modus operandi. They wouldn't act in such a... brutal manner.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ayerscarpe"
    },
    {
        "text": "But if he was helping the insurgents to try to save more lives...? Why?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ayerscarpe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_294_ayer",
        "name2": "char_328_cammou",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Is this really going to save lives, at the end of the day? GreyThroat says Wolumonde is in a real bad spot right now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Click"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_294_ayer",
        "name2": "char_328_cammou",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No. The Contingency Contract is just a platform.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ayerscarpe"
    },
    {
        "text": "It is true that a small percentage of the Messengers using the Contingency Contract have a utilitarian obsession, leading them to 'save' as many people as possible.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ayerscarpe"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wolumonde had already suffered a Catastrophe. Could he have... set the fire to draw in outside forces to intervene...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ayerscarpe"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm so glad Leonhardt and Rhodes Island's other Catastrophe Messengers don't get so mixed up with them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ayerscarpe"
    },
    {
        "text": "But... that can't be right... What if..",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ayerscarpe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_294_ayer",
        "name2": "char_328_cammou",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Ayerscarpe!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Click"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_294_ayer",
        "name2": "char_328_cammou",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What is it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ayerscarpe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_294_ayer",
        "name2": "char_328_cammou",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Look over there! By the music store! What's that weird thing?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Click"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_294_ayer",
        "name2": "char_328_cammou",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It's a... mountain?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ayerscarpe"
    },
    {
        "text": "No. It's a big moving boulder?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ayerscarpe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_294_ayer",
        "name2": "char_328_cammou",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Could it be that one guy's Arts?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Click"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_294_ayer",
        "name2": "char_328_cammou",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "That isn't the kind of thing one man's Arts can do. Let's hurry back to the others!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ayerscarpe"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's no way an ordinary town militia is going to stand against a battle-hardened combat squad, and a Sarkaz one at that!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ayerscarpe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
