    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$frontline_intro",
        "key": "$frontline_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$smallearthquake",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 2,
        "xstrength": 4,
        "ystrength": 4,
        "vibrato": 20,
        "randomness": 30,
        "fadeout": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_065"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's that? An earthquake?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Townsfolk"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah! It's that rock monster again! Quick! Start the 'Gramophone!'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Townsfolk"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_067",
        "name2": "avg_npc_067",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "They came! Reunion is here to liberate us!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Armed Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_067",
        "name2": "avg_npc_067",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Long live Reunion! Forward! Drive out the rotten nobles!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Armed Infected A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_067",
        "name2": "avg_npc_067",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Long live Reunion!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Armed Infected B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_ltstreet2",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Cover their retreat. Get back to the town center and activate the Gramophone. And stay safe!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_065"
    },
    {
        "text": "Got it!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Townsfolk"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tatjana, that one at the end of the street... do you know him?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Townsfolk"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_011#2",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Halt. At ease.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_011#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes. We are now just one step away.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Warrior"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_011#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "One step away from destroying this town.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock"
    },
    {
        "text": "But there is no hope behind us. They cheer for liberation. But all we have freed is their anger and hatred. This is a typical, bloody invasion.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_011#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Is it? I don't really care. At this point, a happy ending is out of the question.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Warrior"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_011#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "This is the last chance... a chance to give them, before we take the last step.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_011#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "A chance to surrender?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Warrior"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_011#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No... a chance to fight back. A chance to show conviction and let us stand in for the people... let us decide the winners and losers for ourselves.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_011#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It's tough, thankless work, being a mercenary. Always the toughest. Never appreciated.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Warrior"
    },
    {
        "text": "Whatever. It's your call.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Warrior"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_011#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014Arise, great boulder.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock"
    },
